flowchart LR
    IN[Input Data]
    VAL[Validation Stage]
    DEC{Validation Passed?}
    ENC[Encryption Stage]
    STG[Encrypted Storage Stage]
    RSK[Risk Analysis Stage]
    OUT[Output and Reporting]

    IN --> VAL
    VAL --> DEC
    DEC -->|Yes| ENC
    DEC -->|No| OUT
    ENC --> STG
    STG --> RSK
    RSK --> OUT